# YouReadIRead — git ignores
#
# This repo holds the agentic logic for the YouReadIRead system. Anything
# that's a development artifact (design docs, runtime caches, OS noise,
# editor scratch) stays out of git. Personal data lives in a *separate*
# private repo (see config.yaml > data_repo.path) and is not in this tree
# at all.

# --- development artifacts (kept on disk for the agent, not in git) ---
docs/superpowers/

# --- claude code runtime artifacts ---
.claude/.todos/
.claude/sessions/
.claude/logs/

# --- python caches ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# --- editor / OS noise ---
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- env / secrets (in case anyone ever introduces them) ---
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
